OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested for murder after body
OL,4,Afound by coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a body was discovered in
OL,8,FAlderney, police have said.
OL,10,FEmergency services including an RNLI
OL,11,Flifeboat were called to an area known
OL,12,Fas The Guns where a person was found
OL,13,Fdead in the early hours of Monday,
OL,14,FGuernsey Police said.
OL,16,FA 44-year-old man was arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of murder and was being
OL,18,Ftreated in hospital while in police
OL,19,Fcustody, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
