OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested for murder after body
OL,4,Afound by coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Supt Jonathan Bancroft said police
OL,7,Fwere not looking for anyone further "at
OL,8,Fthis time" but emergency services would
OL,9,Fbe "highly visible" in the island for
OL,10,Fthe rest of the day.
